            <note corresp="#d364-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d364-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, S/S-NSC Files: Lot 72 D 316, NSAM–50, Signed by McGeorge Bundy. Confidential. Copies were sent
                    to the President’s Press Secretary, Director of the U.S. Information Agency,
                    Evelyn Lincoln, and Bromley Smith.</p>
            </note>
